file content here[/SAVE_FILE]**
    *   *Purpose:* Saves specified content into a file in the `outputs/` directory.
3.  **[RUN_CODE]python code here[/RUN_CODE]**
    *   *Purpose:* Executes the provided Python code in a sandboxed environment.
4.  **[BUILD_MODULE: module_name|short description]python code[/BUILD_MODULE]**
    *   *Purpose:* Creates a new, self-contained Python module, registers it, and makes it available for use.
5.  **[LIST_MODULES]**
    *   *Purpose:* Lists all currently available and registered Python modules.
6.  **[LIST_OUTPUTS]**
    *   *Purpose:* Lists all files that have been generated in the `outputs/` directory.
7.  **[SHELL: command]**
    *   *Purpose:* Executes arbitrary shell commands directly in the environment.